<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 4-1 AT CLOSE OF FOURTH DAY.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 4-1 AT CLOSE OF FOURTH DAY.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa were four for one at the close of the fourth day of the third and final test against India on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 410-9 and 266-8 declared; South Africa 321 and 4-1.</p>
</text>
